/target
/ui/node_modules
/.superpowers
*.sqlite*
# A hand-run `np scan tests/fixtures/corpus` must not leave a catalog behind: the CLI and scan tests copy
# that corpus wholesale and assert its file count. The `.tmp` line covers the corpse of a rename killed
# between writing the temporary and renaming it.
tests/fixtures/corpus/INDEX*.md
tests/fixtures/corpus/INDEX*.tmp
# The pinned llama.cpp source, fetched once by scripts/vendor-llama-cpp.sh (§14). Never committed,
# and never fetched by cargo: build.rs only ever reads a directory that already exists.
/.vendor
